  "summary": "Founder-led 20-staff turner (2-5 M EUR), our A supplier: ~EUR 569k is ~11-28 % of its turnover. Looking for new customers, second shift idle, owner admits stale costing (twice) and calls us a reference customer. Wear ring set (single source) rose 8.5 % since 2022 while its other parts fell; shaft sleeve and spacer have active second sources. Open deep, use any indices that fell, the amber scorecard with 5 open 8D, and share shifts; pay on time as the sweetener.",
